{'symbol': 'ABT', 'date': '2022-01-04 09:00:00', 'title': "ABBOTT'S PROCLAIM™ XR SPINAL CORD STIMULATION SYSTEM NOW OFFERS EXPANDED MRI COMPATIBILITY IN U.S.", 'text': 'ABBOTT PARK, ILL., JAN. 4, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- ABBOTT (NYSE: ABT) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT THE U.S. FOOD AND DRUG ADMINISTRATION (FDA) HAS APPROVED NEW EXPANDED MAGNETIC RESONANCE IMAGING (MRI) COMPATIBILITY FOR ITS PROCLAIM™\xa0XR SPINAL CORD STIMULATION (SCS) SYSTEM WITH OCTRODE™\xa0LEADS.'}